        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                "word": "oligarque",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4ac3d863-c829-4d5d-9585-a589045f6d6e",
                        "entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "oligarques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef4b1843-5e7c-36bb-9c37-ad7c73da24f8",
                        "entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Individu qui participe à un gouvernement oligarchique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d66709f-0afd-4237-b853-ee690186a2a7",
                                "sense_id": "ef4b1843-5e7c-36bb-9c37-ad7c73da24f8",
                                "text": "À l’approche de l’armée française, la question, tant agitée à Venise, du parti à prendre entre l’Autriche et la France, fut discutée de nouveau par le sénat. Quelques vieux oligarques, qui avaient conservé de l’énergie, auraient voulu qu’on s’alliât sur-le-champ à l’Autriche, patronne naturelle de tous les vieux despotismes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2688a733-64fc-37d0-99b0-6a3b6f0a8334",
                        "entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne appartenant au groupe qui détient le pouvoir dans un secteur donné."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a09e721-4e1d-4f24-8458-ac73c665f27c",
                                "sense_id": "2688a733-64fc-37d0-99b0-6a3b6f0a8334",
                                "text": "Un plagiste de la Garoupe, à Antibes, raconte encore l’histoire d’un oligarque qui lui a réservé dernièrement la totalité de sa plage et les quarante matelas pour une semaine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac011a89-8193-44a7-b62f-352fe98d6f14",
                                "sense_id": "2688a733-64fc-37d0-99b0-6a3b6f0a8334",
                                "text": "Ces repaires de la banque et des grands marchands parlent d’une richesse séculaire et de puissants oligarques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6de7bb52-bf4d-4504-8250-67f09e56a7fc",
                                "sense_id": "2688a733-64fc-37d0-99b0-6a3b6f0a8334",
                                "text": "Gibraltar a vendu, pour 39,2 millions d’euros, le yacht saisi de l’oligarque russe Dmitry Pumpyansky, visé par des sanctions occidentales."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "358aaebd-148f-46b4-a85b-ab4e9da9e10b",
                        "source_entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                        "target_lang_word": "Oligarch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Oligarch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8dac2f01-babd-372a-973e-dbd6cbc6177b",
                                        "entry_id": "ef17e48c-eeff-3c9d-96bb-088af225be98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Angehöriger einer kleinen Gruppe, die politische Macht über ein Land oder eine Region hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cea68e6a-2897-48e7-9658-5922c3d326b6",
                                                "sense_id": "8dac2f01-babd-372a-973e-dbd6cbc6177b",
                                                "text": "Die russischen Oligarchen sind zumeist in der Gorbatschow-Ära reich geworden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ab7a30-3a95-432c-a1ac-6d2c4e2987e7",
                                                "sense_id": "8dac2f01-babd-372a-973e-dbd6cbc6177b",
                                                "text": "„Präsident Poroschenko hat schon in früheren Regierungen hohe Posten eingenommen, als Oligarch trieb er im Kartell mit anderen einst die Zuckerpreise hoch.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1fb23d83-ed8e-41eb-9773-dfde6467d882",
                        "source_entry_id": "f44acd19-91b3-38a1-a1d8-72b063cdf138",
                        "target_lang_word": "oligarch",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oligarch",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca2be401-def8-3e02-95c7-e2ecbf492764",
                                        "entry_id": "2840eed5-c0e2-36e3-9ad7-e3e34a816301",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an oligarchy; someone who is part of a small group that runs a country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                        "entry_id": "2840eed5-c0e2-36e3-9ad7-e3e34a816301",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very wealthy business owner who wields political power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1608aae2-4df9-456d-8a86-4abfa4279876",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "Millions of people were starving, while the oligarchs and their supporters were surfeiting on the surplus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d83c1d71-4db4-45e3-8387-66dd136451f1",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "Economic disaster loomed, as the rotting remains of the Soviet economy were exposed to free-market reforms, which brought inflation and the sale of state-owned assets at low prices to a new class of ultra-rich businessmen called \"oligarchs,\" who made America's robber barons of the late nineteenth century look like Puritan preachers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6852a36-ff2b-4438-9b76-67e8c550bf65",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "But then, this is Ukraine. Since the country won its independence in the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991, Parliament has become dominated by the oligarchs - enormously wealthy industrial managers who have interests in steel, iron, coal, the media and soccer clubs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f75f8ab-889c-48e8-b470-8daba0c5b766",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "Ukraine's oligarchs emerged in parallel to Russia's, who have been more closely studied, and they were quite similar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1130d44a-1597-429c-9e62-f631a8c801fe",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "The astronomical sales of the tome have proven once and for all that for teen girls and young women in Russia, the allure of marrying an oligarch is many times more powerful than acquiring fame or intellectual status."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39faa110-ccdf-4a70-94af-5e2c994a5240",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "Borisovich said he also wanted to highlight how a group of “enablers”, such as lawyers, accountants, and bankers, were helping oligarchs launder their “ill-gotten gains” by investing the cash in prime London mansions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de39b9ae-345e-45d6-9b94-13fd50485870",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "He will be an oligarch in the Russian mold: a rich man who used his wealth to gain political power and who would use political power to enrich himself once in office."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8edac5fe-034a-442d-9f35-d0719b42d1d2",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "On the campaign trail, Zelenskiy pledged to clean up Ukraine’s oligarch-dominated ruling system."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a011bdcc-6793-497f-b05f-bdead6c44e01",
                                                "sense_id": "db4710b7-ac31-3125-b27e-5b608e37a24b",
                                                "text": "Lingelbach told me that Elon Musk went from tycoon to oligarch when he bought Twitter last year. The social media company, now renamed X, shapes opinion on events from Ukraine to Israel—often by platforming falsehoods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1cb9181-aec9-3834-adda-7c28a2e1caaa",
                                        "entry_id": "2840eed5-c0e2-36e3-9ad7-e3e34a816301",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A protoplanet formed during oligarchic accretion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7150f9ec-f3be-434b-b701-cb4ec67f2b13",
                                                "sense_id": "d1cb9181-aec9-3834-adda-7c28a2e1caaa",
                                                "text": "In the inner Solar System, only the asteroid Ceres was able to grow fast enough to become a dwarf planet, but in the outer Solar System huge numbers of icy bodies formed, ranging from pebbles to the oligarchs now recognized as dwarf planets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
